  "Applies to JPEG, WebP, AVIF and HEIC. PNG and GIF are optimised by tools with no comparable setting, so they look the same whichever you choose. Standard matches what earlier versions of Shrinker Pro produced. Every session starts here; the window's session bar can change it for one session without changing this.": "適用於JPEG、WebP、AVIF和HEIC。PNG和GIF由沒有同類設定的工具來最佳化，所以無論你選哪一項，結果看起來都一樣。「標準」與Shrinker Pro舊版本產生的結果相同。每次開始時都用這一項；視窗上的今次設定列可以只改今次，而不改動這項設定。",
